BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 213.57 Tm (  add to it; some overhead sits outside the cooled space, so scaling by full PUE would overshoot. No) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 202.37 Tm (  PUE multiplier is applied.) Tj ET
